{"sourceUrl":"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/f0/4e/c28139a782414/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:35.906631+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/f0/4e/c28139a782414/page.htm","html":"<div><p><strong><span><span>复旦大学生命科学学院、复杂性状的遗传调控全国重点实验室、生物学国家高层次人才培养中心 2026年全国优秀本科生夏令营通知</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>2026</span>年是复旦大学生命科学学科创建<span>100</span>周年。为了赓续百年生科的薪火，加强青年学子之间的学术交流，</span><span>激发同学们对</span><span>生命科学前沿</span><span>的兴趣，</span><span>增进对我单位研究生教育的深入了解，复旦大学生命科学学院、复杂性状的遗传调控全国重点实验室和生物学国家高层次人才培养中心联合举办<span>2026</span>年全国优秀本科生夏令营。报名阶段相关事宜通知如下：</span></p><p><span>一、报名时间</span></p><p><span>6<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>日</span>10:00</span><span>-</span><span>6<span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span>17:00</span></span></p><p><span>二、报名条件</span></p><p><span>1.<span>全国各高等学校</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>年应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>2.<span>学</span></span><span>业</span><span>成绩</span><span>和英语成绩优秀，预计可获得推免生资格。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>对生命科学和生态学有浓厚的学术研究兴趣，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，将来有志于报考我院生物学、生态学</span><span>和人类学</span><span><span>学科的</span><span>2</span></span><span>027</span><span>级直接攻博生。</span></p><p><span>三、报名材料</span></p><p><span>1.<span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版</span><span>JPG</span><span>格式，</span><span>150×200</span><span>像素，大小</span><span>500K</span><span>以内。</span></span></p><p><span>2.<span>本科阶段</span></span><span>现有完整</span><span><span>成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章），</span>JPG<span>或</span><span>PDF</span><span>格式。</span></span></p><p><span>3.<span>外语水平证明，如</span><span>CET-4</span><span>、</span><span>CET-6</span><span>、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></span></p><p><span>4.<span>有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作。</span></span></p><p><span>5.<span>诚信承诺书（可从报考服务系统下载，签名后上传）。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span>个人简历。</span></p><p><span>四、报名方式</span></p><p><span><span>申请人登录复旦大学研究生招生网（</span>https://gsao.fudan.edu.cn<span>）</span><span>,</span><span>通过</span><span>“</span><span>研究生报考服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>中的</span><span>“</span></span><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营</span><span><span>”</span><span>进行网上报名。</span></span></p><p><span>我单位无需寄送纸质材料。</span></p><p><span>五</span><span>、</span><span>相关说明</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>本次活动预计在</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>7</span><span>日</span><span>- 9</span><span>日举行，以实际通知为准。计划营员人数约</span><span>1</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>0</span><span>人。活动内容包括各学科领域发展介绍讲座、师生座谈、实验室参观等，具体安排另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>为外地营员提供食宿条件，原则上不安排上海高校学生住宿。</span></span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.<span>申请人应承诺填报信息和提交材料的真实性。如有弄虚作假，一经发现将取消</span></span><span>申请</span><span>资格</span><span>并通报其本科院校</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>咨询方式：</span><span>021-31246508，邮箱：</span><span>life_gs@fudan.edu.cn</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>                            </span><span>复旦大学</span><span>生命科学学院</span></p><p><span>                                 202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_xls.gif\"/><a href=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/4d/d5/0c8ddfda4ec18e26167e6d1ce46a/1785a0a9-bf10-4972-bbff-2bc8b343a5f4.xlsx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">招收直博生导师研究方向关键词.xlsx</a></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>同学们可以通过上表快速查询感兴趣研究方向的导师</span><span>）<br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://life.fudan.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/4d/d5/0c8ddfda4ec18e26167e6d1ce46a/95a3ee97-c537-4288-8f26-c3f5bc56f41d.png\"/></p><p><span>欢迎扫码了解我院研究生教育工作!</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f2f636b98ec5492ec754fcc2d056d9d9f52e10ea0b8427cc5b503aea2bc87437","textLength":935,"sourceSha256":"aa47a3b2b609680d9a45379688e726a6bfb749f3547892eb39bb7dc9a2c61c47","selector":".wp_articlecontent","atta